  "title": "Spatial Attention Decoding using fNIRS During Complex Scene Analysis",
  "description": "This dataset contains functional near-infrared spectroscopy (fNIRS) recordings collected while participants performed spatial attention tasks during complex auditory scene analysis. It supports research on decoding the focus of spatial attention from hemodynamic signals. The data are organized in BIDS format and accompany a published data paper.",
